WEBVTT

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:07.070
I activate my spell card Polymerization 
from my hand,

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:13.760
to fuse Predaplant Flytrap and Predaplant 
Moray Nepenthes in my hand!

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.680
Two beautiful flowers, which use alluring 
fragrance to attract insects.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:24.970
Now become one, and from the 
hell of your petals,

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.690
birth a new terror.

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:31.180
Fusion Summon!

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:35.420
Appear, poisonous dragon with hungry fangs!

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:41.320
Level 8 Starving Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:02.540
D-Wheels.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.830
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:08.510
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:11.900
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:14.090
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:53.020
The Ill-Fated Reunion

00:02:58.590 --> 00:03:00.910
Something must be happening to Yuya...

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:03.560
Tell me. Where is Yuya right now?

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:12.040
N-No... No!

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:14.970
What's going on here?

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:17.540
What's about to happen?

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:54.620
Yuya!

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:58.420
I've... been waiting...

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:03.590
Waiting for this moment.

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:09.140
Now... Now I'll be revived.

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.700
Revived.

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:14.350
We'll become one...

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:17.220
We'll become one.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:23.760
This way? Is it this way?

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.060
What's with that sky?

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.180
Strange weather, all of a sudden.

00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:56.200
Lord Joeri?

00:04:56.200 --> 00:04:57.140
Lord Joeri!

00:04:57.970 --> 00:05:01.310
Become one... Become one.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:05.020
Become one... Become one...

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:08.710
We'll become one.

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:11.670
We'll become one.

00:05:13.220 --> 00:05:15.530
What is the meaning of this?

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:28.400
Now, we'll become one!

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:29.370
Yuya!

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:31.780
Yuya!

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:39.280
Lord Joeri...

00:05:47.960 --> 00:05:48.660
Yuya!

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:51.160
Yuzu!

00:05:51.900 --> 00:05:53.240
Yuzu?

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:57.600
It disappeared.

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:00.040
Yuya, hang in there.

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.640
Yuzu, what are you doing here?

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:05.620
Yuzu Hiiragi...

00:06:06.080 --> 00:06:08.490
Having my prey come straight to me

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:11.480
means I no longer need to continue this duel!

00:06:11.480 --> 00:06:12.960
Not good.

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:14.450
Run, Yuzu!

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.990
Yuzu Hiiragi... Lady Serena.

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:18.910
Come with me, to the Professor.

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:20.380
No way...

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.740
I won't let you have Yuzu or Serena!

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:26.230
I'll fight you to the bitter end!

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:27.700
Yuya...

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:31.140
Damn it!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:35.450
The effect of my Beastborg 
Medal of the Crimson Chain

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:40.520
means you cannot use spells or traps, 
and you cannot summon new monsters.

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:42.980
Are you sure you want to continue?

00:06:43.240 --> 00:06:45.830
I'll continue... I won't give up!

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:50.420
Your determination to go so 
far to protect your allies...

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:51.420
It's magnificent.

00:06:52.590 --> 00:06:56.530
As a fellow duelist, and as 
a warrior, I respect that.

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:59.110
Then, as you wish,

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:01.130
let us finish this duel.

00:07:01.450 --> 00:07:02.620
Yuya!

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:04.300
He's from Academia!

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:11.160
I swore that I wouldn't let Academia 
take you or Serena.

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.150
So, stand back, Yuzu.

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:20.100
Yuya Sakaki,

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:24.620
acknowledging you as a proud 
warrior, I will show no mercy.

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:26.350
Battle!

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:31.240
Panther Predator attacks Dark 
Rebellion Xyz Dragon.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:37.530
Due to Beastborg Medal of the Crimson 
Chain's effect, it isn't destroyed,

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:39.350
but you still take the damage.

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:44.510
In that instant, Beastborg Medal of 
the Steel Chain's effect activates!

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:47.480
When damage is dealt to you,

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:52.320
all monsters on your side of the field lose attack 
points, equal to the damage you took.

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:58.990
And Wolf Kampfer's effect activates!

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:05.130
When you take battle damage, it deals 
an additional 300 damage to you.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:07.230
And in that instant,

00:08:07.530 --> 00:08:10.540
Beastborg Medal of the Steel Chain's 
effect activates once more!

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:13.720
The attack points of both dragons decrease.

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:18.680
Both of Yuya's dragons are 
down to 0 attack points!

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:21.310
You have 600 life left.

00:08:21.310 --> 00:08:24.900
On my next turn, I'll finish it off.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.820
You have no chance of victory!

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:30.360
I now end my turn.

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:33.160
Now, noble warrior,

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:38.220
if you can still see a light of hope, 
aim for it and come at me.

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:39.780
Hope...

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:44.410
Is this hope?

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:48.310
Dad... Mom...

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:55.050
I can't see it. The way I am now,

00:08:55.490 --> 00:08:58.310
how can I bring hope to this situation?

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.160
My turn!

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:07.160
He's...

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:08.630
Sergey!

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:12.100
2000-point penalty for entering the battle.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.060
Yuzu Hiiragi...

00:09:18.600 --> 00:09:21.460
I came for Serena, but found Yuzu, as well.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.240
Sergey, take them in!

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:28.980
I activate my Field Spell Earthbound Prison.

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.890
Yuzu! Are you okay?

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:43.760
I'm fine. I'm fine, but...

00:09:44.130 --> 00:09:46.360
Wait! I'll get you out soon!

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:54.800
Well done...

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:58.650
Now, all that remains is to remove 
Academia, and bring Serena in.

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:17.460
Field Spell Earthbound Prison negates 
changes to attack points.

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:21.930
It also halves the life points of the 
player who destroys this card,

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:27.910
and negates the effects of monsters 
on that player's side of the field.

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:30.300
Are you trying to interrupt me?

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:33.880
I will allow no interference in my 
honorable duel with Yuya Sakaki!

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:37.800
Can't you hear me?

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:40.170
I don't have time to deal with you.

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:43.090
Release Yuzu Hiiragi, and get out of here!

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:45.930
When there is a Field Spell on the field,

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:51.060
I can Special Summon Earthbound 
Prisoner Stone Sweeper.

00:10:56.280 --> 00:11:02.140
I also summon Tuner Monster Earthbound 
Prisoner Line Walker from my hand.

00:11:02.530 --> 00:11:05.360
Damn you, determined to get in my way?

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:11.700
And I activate my spell card Harmonic 
Synchro Fusion from my hand.

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:16.090
Its effect allows me to Synchro 
and Fusion Summon,

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:20.020
using two monsters on the field.

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:21.230
What?

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:23.490
Simultaneous Synchro and Fusion Summons?

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:29.470
Level 3 Line Walker tunes 
Level 5 Stone Sweeper!

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:35.850
From deep within the ground, be reborn,

00:11:35.850 --> 00:11:39.030
giant beast with wings that deal out punishment.

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:41.750
Synchro Summon!

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:49.320
Appear, Level 8 Earthbound 
Servant Geo Gryphon!

00:11:51.720 --> 00:11:55.940
And I fuse Stone Sweeper and Line Walker!

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:58.190
Prisoner who crawls along the ground,

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:01.730
become one with the prisoner who 
walks the road to the gallows.

00:12:02.080 --> 00:12:04.670
Become the giant beast who deals out punishment.

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:06.370
Fusion Summon!

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:11.910
Appear, Level 8 Earthbound Servant Geo Kraken!

00:12:12.340 --> 00:12:13.580
Behold!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:18.570
A new strategy, a hybrid of the 
duels of Academia and City...

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:21.750
A new generation of duels, which only 
I could have produced.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:24.570
Now, do it, Sergey!

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:28.060
Bury the duelist of old Academia!

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:29.890
Battle!

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:34.570
I attack Wolf Kampfer with Geo Kraken!

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:39.040
Not enough...

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:41.710
When Wolf Kampfer is destroyed by battle,

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:45.640
I can Special Summon its component 
monsters from the graveyard!

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:53.750
Geo Gryphon attacks Panther Predator!

00:12:57.300 --> 00:13:00.360
When Panther Predator is destroyed by battle,

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:03.560
I can Special Summon its component 
monsters from the graveyard!

00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:12.520
But in that moment, the loss of the Beastborg 
from my side of the field means

00:13:12.520 --> 00:13:18.580
that Continuous Traps Medal of the Steel Chain 
and Medal of the Crimson Chain are destroyed.

00:13:23.270 --> 00:13:23.920
Yuzu!

00:13:24.200 --> 00:13:26.880
Yuya! I'm glad you're okay.

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:28.380
What are you saying?

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:31.420
You're trapped in there. It's no 
time to worry about me—

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:33.260
Damn it!

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:36.570
I guess there's no way to get you out.

00:13:36.570 --> 00:13:42.130
Don't worry. I'll defeat that man and free you.

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:46.320
Though, you'll be separated 
soon thereafter, anyway.

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:49.080
I won't let you do it!

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:53.740
Didn't you say you'd defeat me? But...

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:55.190
Are you so sure?

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:59.800
All of my monsters are fusion components.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:02.480
Continuous Spell Beastborg Fusioner

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:07.960
will let me Fusion Summon my 
Beastborgs again, next turn!

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:11.160
You won't have a next turn.

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:13.610
What? Stop bluffing!

00:14:21.930 --> 00:14:24.750
Geo Kraken's monster effect.

00:14:24.750 --> 00:14:30.620
I destroy all monsters Special Summoned 
to my opponent's field during my turn!

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:31.280
What?!

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:32.120
All of them?

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:46.400
And for each monster destroyed, 
you take 800 points of damage.

00:14:58.550 --> 00:15:00.090
B-Barrett...

00:15:01.060 --> 00:15:02.580
Commander Barrett!

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:05.880
L-Lady Serena...

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:11.560
I wish I could have... taken you...

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:16.030
personally... to the Professor.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:17.750
Barrett...

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:19.360
Stop it!

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:21.500
Don't take Serena back!

00:15:21.800 --> 00:15:23.270
Stop it!

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:24.940
Serena!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:28.010
Lady Serena...

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:38.700
Serena is...

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:39.790
No...

00:15:41.080 --> 00:15:42.390
The commander...

00:15:42.950 --> 00:15:46.290
You idiot! How could you let her go?!

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.500
Just take Yuzu Hiiragi into custody.

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:51.530
I will not permit further failure!

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:55.910
Yuzu... I'll protect Yuzu, at least!

00:15:56.470 --> 00:16:00.860
In the last duel, you knocked 
Yuzu off the duel lane.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:05.110
I won't forgive you for that!

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:06.470
Yuya...

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:11.400
I set one card and end my turn.

00:16:12.590 --> 00:16:14.290
My turn!

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:18.060
Please, Yuya! Don't surrender to anger!

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:22.970
I activate my spell card Magical Thunder!

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:28.090
This card lets me send one spell card 
from my hand to the graveyard,

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:30.600
to destroy one card on the field!

00:16:30.910 --> 00:16:32.330
I see...

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:36.080
Using spell cards to destroy his monster?

00:16:36.080 --> 00:16:39.900
But Sergey's set card is Earthbound Spell Sealer.

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:44.080
When his opponent activates a spell card,

00:16:44.080 --> 00:16:48.020
that trap can negate and destroy it.

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:53.220
Sergey's mind has anticipated 
everything you might try...

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:57.830
The way you were acting before, you were 
so scary, I didn't recognize you.

00:16:59.370 --> 00:17:03.230
It was like you had become a different person.

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:05.850
I don't want to see you that way again!

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:14.810
Dad... Mom...

00:17:16.440 --> 00:17:19.050
I... I...

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:21.470
Listen to me.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:23.900
No matter where you go, don't forget your smile.

00:17:24.390 --> 00:17:26.750
Duels make people happy.

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:28.630
They make them smile.

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:33.800
The way I am now, I can't make people smile.

00:17:35.680 --> 00:17:38.100
But... If one person...

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:40.860
If only Yuzu...

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:46.040
I send Smile World to the graveyard, 
to destroy one card!

00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:48.780
So, which will you destroy?

00:17:48.780 --> 00:17:51.020
Geo Gryphon or Geo Kraken?

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:57.190
I destroy Field Spell Earthbound Prison!

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:02.920
What's wrong, Sergey?

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:04.720
Use Earthbound Spell Sealer!

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.100
Hurry, before you lose your chance!

00:18:15.740 --> 00:18:18.110
Earthbound Prison's effect activates.

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:22.170
It halves the life of the player who destroyed it,

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:26.220
negating the effects of the monsters 
on that player's side of the field!

00:18:33.240 --> 00:18:34.310
Yuya...

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:39.500
He did it to free Yuzu, even knowing 
he'd take damage?

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:40.820
Yuya!

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:42.230
Wait!

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:44.700
You're coming with us!

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:45.400
Yuzu!

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:46.650
Hazy Shuriken!

00:18:49.430 --> 00:18:50.970
Stay back, or I'll strike!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.540
Tsukikage...

00:18:52.880 --> 00:18:55.530
I thought we'd take the other back.

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:58.300
But with both Commander 
Barrett and Lord Joeri out,

00:18:58.300 --> 00:18:59.760
we can't stay much longer.

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:01.700
Yeah. Let's withdraw!

00:19:09.610 --> 00:19:12.530
No... Don't go.

00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:15.660
Master Yuya, you may duel without fear.

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:17.750
Thanks, Tsukikage.

00:19:18.380 --> 00:19:21.120
I activate Xiangke Magician's Pendulum Effect

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:25.420
to set Rank 4 Dark Rebellion 
Xyz Dragon to Level 4!

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:44.800
And I use Xiangsheng Magician's 
Pendulum Effect

00:19:44.800 --> 00:19:47.450
to set it to Level 7, equal to that of Odd-Eyes!

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:06.220
I overlay Level 7 Odd-Eyes and Dark Rebellion!

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:10.650
Dragon with different-colored eyes,

00:20:10.650 --> 00:20:14.890
exterminate your enemies with your black wrath!

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:16.630
Xyz Summon!

00:20:17.080 --> 00:20:19.340
Come out, Rank 7...

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:25.530
With shining eyes of fury! 
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon!

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:27.980
Battle!

00:20:27.980 --> 00:20:31.480
Odd-Eyes Rebellion Dragon 
attacks Geo Gryphon!

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:34.950
Wrath of Rebellion... Strike Disobey!

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:44.660
In that instant, Geo Gryphon's 
monster effect activates!

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:47.400
When an Earthbound Servant 
monster is destroyed,

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:49.890
I destroy one of your monsters!

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:59.530
And your turn is over.

00:20:59.530 --> 00:21:01.790
You cannot defeat Sergey.

00:21:01.790 --> 00:21:05.040
Now, go... It is the final turn, Sergey!

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:10.230
I attack directly with Geo Kraken!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.760
Y-Yuya!

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:27.770
Lady Yuzu!

00:21:27.770 --> 00:21:29.230
Capture her, Sergey!

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:36.510
Yuzu!

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:53.080
Y-Yuzu...

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:57.500
Yuzu!

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:01.660
Yuya!

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:54.040
Due to last night's events, we're changing 
the pairing for the semifinals.

00:23:54.040 --> 00:23:59.000
Sergey will fight City's biggest star, Jack Atlas!

00:23:59.000 --> 00:24:03.190
Jack Atlas is the hope of both 
Tops and Commons.

00:24:03.190 --> 00:24:06.160
I shall use Sergey to crush him in a duel.

00:24:06.160 --> 00:24:11.060
The resulting despair will be 
the prologue to a new hope.

00:24:12.000 --> 00:24:15.640
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Duel Machine of Destruction.

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:17.670
The fun is only getting started!
